# Build context for docker/watchdog.Dockerfile, which is built from this folder
# because nodeWatchdog.sh lives here.
#
# Exclude everything, then re-include only the script. Nothing else belongs in the
# context: earnapp.txt holds node UUIDs and proxies.txt holds proxy credentials,
# neither of which should be sent to the Docker daemon, and earnappdata/ would make
# the build slow for no reason.
*
!nodeWatchdog.sh
